# fifo_op_delay: Delay (61) with its 8-byte payload never signals: later stamps on the FIFO complete but stay unpublished behind it, with no fault; 0x1024 then finds no faulted head and changes nothing. Teardown drains the FIFO and hangs: the outcome is the watchdog, in teardown (docs/testing.md, section 7.4).
